          {
            "title": "Local scope",
            "id": 86990,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variáveis criadas dentro de uma função têm um <strong>escopo local</strong>, como <code>bonus</code> aqui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bonus&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bonus</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>As variáveis criadas dentro de uma função têm um <strong>escopo local</strong>. Dê ao <code>bonus</code> local o valor <code>100</code> para que o código exiba <code>2000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bonus</code> seguido de <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Local scope 2",
            "id": 86991,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com um escopo local, só podemos acessar ou atualizar a variável dentro da função que a criou. Tente definir <code>bonus</code> para <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bonus</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você só pode acessar ou atualizar uma variável local dentro da função que a criou.</p><p>Atualize <code>bonus</code> para o código exibir <code>2100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bonus</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Error",
            "id": 86992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se tentarmos acessar ou atualizar a variável fora do bloco da função, como aqui com <code>bonus</code>, receberemos um erro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'bonus' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bonus</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Local scope",
            "id": 87035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando uma variável tem um escopo local?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando o criamos dentro de um bloco de função</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variáveis sempre têm um escopo local</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando o criamos dentro de um bloco de função.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você cria <code>title</code> fora de todas as funções e <code>message</code> dentro de <code>greet()</code>. Qual tem escopo local?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>message</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code> e <code>message</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>message</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Local scope 2",
            "id": 87036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que significa uma variável ter um escopo local?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não podemos acessá-la ou atualizá-la fora da função onde foi criada</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Podemos acessá-lo de qualquer lugar no código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não podemos acessá-la ou atualizá-la fora da função onde foi criada.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acessar uma variável local fora da função que a criou gera um erro.</p><p>Você chama uma função que cria <code>discount = 5</code> e tenta <code>print(discount)</code> fora dela. O que acontece?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O Python informa um erro porque <code>discount</code> é local à função.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O Python exibe <code>5</code> porque a função criou a variável.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python exibe <code>None</code> porque a variável está fora da função.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O Python informa um erro porque <code>discount</code> é local à função.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error",
            "id": 87037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando tentamos acessar uma variável de escopo local fora da função que a criou?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nós recebemos um erro</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada acontece, podemos acessá-lo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nós recebemos um erro.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tentar acessar uma variável local fora da função que a criou causa um erro.</p><p>Uma função cria <code>total</code>. Qual alteração permite que ela exiba esse valor sem erro de escopo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mova <code>print(total)</code> para dentro do bloco de código da função.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chame a função primeiro e depois use <code>print(total)</code> fora dela.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Renomeie <code>total</code> apenas na chamada externa de <code>print()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mova <code>print(total)</code> para dentro do bloco de código da função.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Local scope",
            "id": 87038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie a variável <code>discount</code>, que tem um escopo local dentro da função <code>apply_discount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"final_price = apply_discount(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(final_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"30\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>discount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Local scope 2",
            "id": 87039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atualize a variável <code>discount</code> para <code>10</code> dentro do escopo local de <code>apply_discount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"final_price = apply_discount(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(final_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>discount = 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Error",
            "id": 87040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique uma linha para imprimir a mensagem de saudação sem acessar a variável <code>greeting</code> fora de seu escopo local da função <code>greet_user</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{greeting}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi Amy!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>f</code>, <code>\"Hi {user}!\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A variável <code>greeting</code> é local a <code>greet_user</code>, então você não pode usá-la aqui fora. Crie uma linha que exiba <code>Hi Amy!</code> por conta própria.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{greeting}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{greeting} {user}!&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Hi {name}!&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi Amy!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>f</code>, <code>\"Hi {user}!\"</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 9778,
        "title": "Escopo global",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Global scope 1",
            "id": 86994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variáveis criadas fora de um bloco de função têm um <strong>escopo global</strong>, como <code>shipping</code> aqui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>shipping</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma variável criada fora de uma função tem <strong>escopo global</strong>, então a função pode lê-la. Crie <code>shipping</code> como <code>10</code> para exibir <code>64</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"cart\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>shipping</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Global access",
            "id": 86995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com um escopo global, podemos <strong>acessar</strong> a variável em qualquer lugar do código, como fizemos com <code>shipping</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>shipping</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Global scope 2",
            "id": 86996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Todas as variáveis têm um escopo global, exceto aquelas criadas dentro de funções, como player_1 aqui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>player_1</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um bloco <code>if</code> não é uma função, portanto <code>player_1</code> continua tendo escopo global. Defina-o como <code>\"Mario\"</code> para exibir <code>Player 1: Mario</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"single_player\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Luigi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>player_1</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Access after creating",
            "id": 86997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mesmo com um escopo global, é importante que possamos acessar variáveis apenas depois de criá-las, como aqui com <code>character</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(character)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>character = \"Mario\"</code> seguido de <code>print(character)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Até uma variável global só pode ser usada depois de ser criada.</p><p>Armazene <code>\"Mario\"</code> em <code>character</code>, copie seu valor para <code>message</code> e exiba <code>message</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"character\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message = &quot;character&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(&quot;message&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>character = \"Mario\"</code> seguido de <code>message = character</code> e finalmente <code>print(message)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Global scope 1",
